WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:05.010
Speaker 1: continuing our sort of tour of
the news here.

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:10.030
It is now time for New York Governor Andrew
Cuomo to resign.

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.990
I that that is my view.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:16.470
Joe Biden said the same yesterday and many
others as well.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:26.160
He has been now accused and investigated for
sexually harassing multiple women.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.500
We now have the results of an investigation.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.710
CNBC summarizes it.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:34.710
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo sexually harassed
multiple women who worked for the state and

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:38.469
elsewhere, according to a report by State
Attorney General Letitia James.

00:00:38.469 --> 00:00:42.559
The investigation concluded Cuomo, quote,
violated federal and state law.

00:00:42.559 --> 00:00:43.559
James said at a.

00:00:43.559 --> 00:00:47.719
Press conference, Cuomo then retaliated against
the former employee who complained publicly

00:00:47.719 --> 00:00:52.479
about his conduct, according to the report,
the probe into numerous women's allegations

00:00:52.479 --> 00:00:57.319
of sexual harassment by Cuomo started in March
after the state's executive chamber granted

00:00:57.319 --> 00:01:04.580
James's request to investigate further coverage
of this Albany D.A. criminally investigating.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:10.370
Cuomo asks any victim of New York governor
sexual harassment to contact office.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:14.680
The D.A. of Albany County said his office
is criminally investigating.

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:20.620
Cuomo D.A. David Sawers said his office would
welcome any victim to contact our office with

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:23.220
additional information about Cuomo.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:26.930
Source said he plans to request investigative
materials from the state attorney general's

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:30.270
probe of the alleged harassment of 11 women.

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:34.610
So listen, for people who were saying, oh,
David, you partizan shill, and you'll bup,

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:35.610
bup, bup, bup.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:36.610
No, hold on, guys.

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:40.820
We're going to have the same standard here
for left and right.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:45.020
Earlier, there were allegations and an investigation
started.

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:48.340
And at that time I said, let's see what the
investigation finds.

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:52.980
We now have an investigation that appears
to have been done without obvious political

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:57.210
bias of some kind where the investigation's
results would not be trustworthy.

00:01:57.210 --> 00:02:03.250
So although there have not been criminal charges
here, the investigation is credible.

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:07.310
And this, in my view now encumbers Andrew
Cuomo, his ability to just be the governor

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:13.819
to such a degree that I believe it is time
for him to resign.

00:02:13.819 --> 00:02:17.129
I don't find myself even needing to say much
more about it.

00:02:17.129 --> 00:02:19.790
It's just time for him to resign.

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:27.769
Now, interestingly, he put out an an 85, 85
page written response.

00:02:27.769 --> 00:02:34.659
There's only 26 pages of text and a lot of
the pages are just pictures of Andrew Cuomo

00:02:34.659 --> 00:02:41.870
and various types of embrace with different
figures, including Joe Biden, with his mom,

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:46.180
Matilda Cuomo with hurricane victims, Sandra
Patterson.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.560
It's basically oh, I'm sorry.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:50.569
This is an example of George W. Bush embracing
hurricane victims.

00:02:50.569 --> 00:02:56.040
Sandra Patterson sort of saying, listen, this
type of hugging is not a big deal.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:57.170
Lots of people do it.

00:02:57.170 --> 00:03:00.079
Here's Barack Obama hugging Hillary Clinton.

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:02.249
It's really just not a big deal.

00:03:02.249 --> 00:03:08.870
Also taking the approach in a video that he
put out of just saying, this is how I interact

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:09.870
with people.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:10.870
I just hug people.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:14.640
There's nothing inappropriate about it, which
is it's sort of like an affirmative defense.

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:17.139
He's not denying the contact with the women.

00:03:17.139 --> 00:03:19.290
He's just saying this is no big deal.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:33.359
Speaker 3: I do it with everyone bright black
and white, young and old, straight to an LGBTQ,

00:03:33.359 --> 00:03:42.129
powerful people, friends, strangers, people
who I meet on the street.

00:03:42.129 --> 00:03:45.980
Speaker 1: So I think it's an interesting
approach.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:51.700
I don't think Andrew Cuomo survives this and
he should resign at this time.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:54.359
If you disagree with me, let me know.

00:03:54.359 --> 00:05:01.750
I would love to hear 
